her infections  scp-1128 infection can be treated with  class c amnestics as it appears memory  of the entity or descriptions of it are  required for its anomalous properties to  take effect  addendum 1128 1  testing with infected d-class have shown  that wireless communication devices  function normally when used by submerged  subjects affected by  scp-1128 see interview 112804  for details  this is interview 1128.04  interview  1128.04  interviewed d 1645  interviewer dr stevens  forward d 1645 was instructed to read  from a small pamphlet describing  scp-1128's appearance then was outfitted  with diving gear and lowered into a  large tub of water via a winch and cable  the 1645's gear was outfitted with a  wireless communication device to allow  contact between himself and dr stevens  and detest if the scp had any effect on  such devices interview has been edited  to remove hazardous information  pertaining to scp-1128  begin log  d-1645 can you hear me over i hear you  doc  damn this thing is deep it looks so tiny  from outside  how well is your reception over it's  good enough i guess it's kind of fuzzy  but i don't know if i can't hear what  you're saying  what is your current status  right now i'm just sinking to the bottom  of  this this the ocean how did you manage  to fit an entire ocean inside a stinkin  bathtub irrelevant d-1645  what are your surroundings  i just said ocean damn it there's fish  in everything don't you guys know what  the hell's inside your own thing  d-1645 what happened  i'm fine i'm fine i just hit the bottom  looks like i've landed on a patch of  seaweed or something what are your  surroundings uh seaweed mostly  wait a second it gets thinner to my  right looks like there might be a drop  off that way should i go take a look  you may  proceed  damn suit's heavy it's hard to move in  this thing  hey is this thing soundproof i hope my  talking isn't scaring off any oh my god  d-1645  d-1645 respond what is your status  i'm okay  i'm o